{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>By the sword</b> — Just as what is not grain falls from the sieve, being of no use, so the wicked of Israel, who say on account of their wickedness that evil will not come near, will perish. And Rabbi Yeshuah said: כִּי בַּעֲדֵנוּ [for our sake] is like אֵלֵינוּ [upon us]."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "I have not identified which 'Rabbi Yeshuah' is intended; the name is transcribed as found."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:42.293599003Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}